The kernel module in this directory is third-party software, not part of the
lmepisowifi project's own AGPLv3 code:

  sch_fq_codel.ko    Fair Queue CoDel packet scheduler (Linux kernel net/sched)

It is built from the Linux kernel and retains its original license. This
NOTICE stands in for a source-file header (the artifact is a compiled kernel
object and cannot carry one). Being shipped in this repository, or in the
release tarballs next to the AGPLv3 scripts that insmod it, does not relicense
it: it is a separate work, loaded into the kernel on demand by lmehspt.sh.

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later

